 112:Core/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_timebase_tim.c **** /**
 113:Core/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_timebase_tim.c ****   * @brief  Suspend Tick increment.
 114:Core/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_timebase_tim.c ****   * @note   Disable the tick increment by disabling TIM2 update interrupt.
